      "content": "That's a good start. I'm trying to structure a section of my report that looks at the feasibility of these programs. When you look at these competing views—the environmental goals versus the economic concerns—are there any particular arguments that are being seen as more \"foundational\" or harder to overcome in the current urban planning climate?",
